  "默认 10，可设 0–100；填 0 表示不限。超出时按修改时间从旧到新回收，分支一律保留，有未提交改动的目录不会被回收。": "Defaults to 10, range 0–100; 0 means no limit. When exceeded, the oldest are removed first by modification time; branches are always kept and worktrees with uncommitted changes are never removed.",
  "保留工作目录": "Keep worktree",
  "超流体完成后，是否保留它的工作目录。": "Whether to keep a finished Superfluid's working directory.",
  "默认关闭：完成后自动回收工作目录（分支一律保留）；失败或中断的超流体从不回收。开启后工作目录会留在磁盘上，可随时手动清理。": "Off by default: finished worktrees are reclaimed automatically (branches are always kept); failed or interrupted Superfluids are never reclaimed. When on, worktrees stay on disk for manual cleanup.",
  "完全信任模式": "Full trust mode",
  "超流体直接在主仓工作区运行，不做 Git 工作目录隔离。默认关闭：开启后不再向超流体施加工具白名单与 MCP 服务器白名单限制。": "Superfluids run directly in the main repository workspace, with no Git worktree isolation. Off by default: when on, the tool allowlist and MCP server allowlist are no longer applied to Superfluids.",
  "开启后超流体保留全部内置工具与共享代理的全部 MCP 服务器，可读写主仓工作区、执行命令，并允许在主仓 push、开 PR、合并。修改后对下一个派发的超流体生效。": "When on, Superfluids keep all built-in tools and every MCP server provided by the host proxy (broker), may read/write the main repository workspace and run commands, and may push, open pull requests and merge in the main repository. Takes effect on the next dispatched Superfluid.",
  "开启后超流体无需审批即可修改主仓文件、执行任意命令并推送/开 PR，仅在你完全信任派生任务时使用。": "In full trust mode Superfluids can modify main-repository files, run arbitrary commands and push/open PRs without approval — only enable it for tasks you fully trust.",
