  "只在面板空闲时运行；默认只预览，不改动文件": "Runs only while the panel is idle; previews by default without touching files",
  "定期整理记忆": "Curate memories on a schedule",
  "空闲时整理记忆文件里由 iFlow 自动维护的那一段：去重、合并，把用处不大的内容移出常用记忆（不再每轮发送）。": "While idle, tidy the part of the memory file that iFlow maintains automatically: dedupe, merge, and move low-value content out of the per-turn memory.",
  "只在没有进行中的回合、没有待处理的审批或提问、没有运行中的超流体，且空闲达到阈值时运行。默认关闭。": "Runs only when no turn is streaming, no approval or question is pending, no Superfluid is running, and the panel has been idle for the threshold. Off by default.",
  "整理策略": "Curation strategy",
  "「只预览」只统计会改动哪些文件，「执行」才真正改写记忆文件。": "Preview only counts what would change; Apply actually rewrites the memory files.",
  "应用策略下每个文件先备份；若期间被其它程序改动则跳过该文件，绝不覆盖。": "When applying, each file is backed up first; a file changed by another program in the meantime is skipped, never overwritten.",
  "只预览（不改文件）": "Preview only (no changes)",
  "执行并改写文件": "Apply and rewrite files",
  "整理周期": "Curation interval",
  "每隔多少天自动整理一次。": "How often automatic curation runs, in days.",
  "空闲阈值": "Idle threshold",
  "面板空闲多少分钟后才整理。": "Only curate after the panel has been idle this many minutes.",
  "全局记忆预算": "Global memory budget",
  "全局记忆里由 iFlow 自动维护的那一段的 token 预算，超出后优先把用处不大的内容移出常用记忆（不再每轮发送）。": "Token budget for the part of global memory that iFlow maintains automatically; when exceeded, low-value content is moved out of the per-turn memory first.",
  "项目记忆预算": "Project memory budget",
  "每个项目记忆文件的 token 预算。": "Token budget for the auto-maintained part of each project memory file.",
  "总量预算": "Total budget",
  "所有自动维护的记忆内容合计的 token 阈值，超出就触发整理。": "Total token threshold across all auto-maintained memory; exceeding it triggers curation.",
  "超过它时即使未到整理周期也会触发整理；冷却期为 6 小时与周期的四分之一中较大者，冷却期内不重复触发。": "When exceeded, curation runs even before the interval elapses; the cooldown is the longer of 6 hours or a quarter of the interval, during which it does not retrigger.",
  "天": "days",
  "分钟": "min",
