  "、": ", ",
  "设置保存在哪里": "Where settings are saved",
  "外观、提示这类面板偏好保存在 VSCode 用户设置里，可以随 VSCode 设置同步。API 配置与密钥、MCP、语言保存在本机 iFlow 配置中（密钥为明文，请注意本机安全），重启内核后由新超流体使用最新配置。": "Panel preferences such as appearance and sound live in your VSCode user settings and follow VSCode Settings Sync. API profiles and keys, MCP and language live in the local iFlow config (keys are plaintext — mind who can read this machine); new Superfluids pick up the latest config after a Core restart.",
  "打开 VSCode 设置": "Open VSCode settings",
  "重启内核，当前会话会自动恢复。语言改动在重启后生效；MCP 仅供超流体使用，重启后的新超流体会通过共享代理加载。": "Restart the Core — the current session comes back automatically. Language changes apply after the restart; MCP is used only by Superfluids, which load it through the shared proxy after a restart.",
  "内容需要是列表（最外层用 [ ]）": "The content must be a list (wrap it in [ ])",
  "JSON 格式有误，请检查括号与引号": "Invalid JSON — check the brackets and quotes",
  "用 JSON 列表写明哪些模型支持思考：每项包含 pattern（模型匹配）与 supportsThinking（是否支持）。保存后写入本机 iFlow 配置，重启内核生效。": "List which models support thinking as JSON: each entry has pattern (which models match) and supportsThinking. Saved to the local iFlow config and applied after a Core restart.",
  "应用修改": "Apply changes",
  "首轮对话结束后，自动给会话起一个简短标题。": "Give the session a short title once its first turn finishes.",
  "每个会话只生成一次，会额外消耗少量 token。": "Generated once per session; costs a small amount of extra tokens.",
  "最多同时运行几个超流体。": "How many Superfluids may run at once.",
  "默认 5，可设 1–20。超出上限的派发会排队，等有空位再开始；调低后已经在跑的超流体不受影响。": "Defaults to 5, adjustable 1–20. Extra dispatches queue up and start when a slot frees; lowering the limit does not interrupt Superfluids already running.",
  "每轮结束可能多花一次模型调用": "Each turn may cost one extra model call",
  "每轮回复结束后，推测你接下来可能想做什么，显示在输入框上方。": "After each reply, guess what you may want next and show it above the composer.",
  "每轮结束会多调用一次模型（消耗额外 token）。关闭后不再调用，已显示的候选会立即清除。": "Adds one model call per turn (extra tokens). When off, no call is made and shown suggestions disappear.",
  "下一步建议最多等多久。": "How long to wait for this suggestion.",
  "回合结束时，标题、下一步建议与记忆提取会合并成一次模型调用，实际按其中最长的时间等待。填 0 表示一直等。": "At the end of a turn, the title, next-step and memory tasks share one model call, so the wait follows the longest limit among them. 0 means wait indefinitely.",
  "上下文快满时自动压缩会话，腾出空间继续对话。": "Compress the conversation when context is nearly full, so you can keep going.",
  "每轮结束后检查一次，达到设定比例就先压缩再继续。默认关闭；即使关闭，模型报「上下文超出上限」时仍会自动压缩。": "Checked after every turn: once occupancy reaches the set percentage, compress before continuing. Off by default; even when off, an overflow error from the model still triggers compression.",
  "压缩最多等多久。": "How long to wait for compression.",
  "默认 0，表示一直等——很大的会话压缩几分钟是正常的。填入秒数后，超时会取消这次压缩并提示你。": "0 by default, meaning no limit — a very large session can legitimately take minutes. Once set, an overrunning compression is cancelled and reported.",
  "上下文用到多少时开始压缩。": "How full the context gets before compression starts.",
  "可调 50–100%，默认 95%。": "Adjustable 50–100%; default 95%.",
  "每轮结束后，找出值得长期记住的偏好与约定。": "After each turn, look for preferences and conventions worth remembering.",
  "用当前模型提取候选，必须经你确认才会写入记忆；每轮会多消耗一次 token。": "The current model proposes candidates; nothing is written until you confirm. Costs one extra call per turn.",
  "记忆提取最多等多久。": "How long to wait for memory extraction.",
  "保存在 VSCode 用户设置里，可随 VSCode 设置同步。": "Stored in your VSCode user settings and carried by VSCode Settings Sync.",
  "以「标准」为基准：紧凑约 0.92 倍字号，大号约 1.1 倍。": "With Standard as the baseline: compact is ≈0.92× the text size, large ≈1.1×.",
  "调整控件之间的间距，不改字号。": "Adjusts spacing between controls; text size stays the same.",
